\":\"As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex seeks new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family — forcing them to navigate co-parenting, identity, and whether love can take a new form.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex seeks new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":121,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ngmu5zGOa7s\",\"displayPriority\":11,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000027\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000883\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004642\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017365\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017366\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017367\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"30\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c59e6ef3-faa4-469e-9fc7-2d8997cff25e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008195\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009287\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008237\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Shelter\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"On a remote coastal island, a man living in self-imposed exile rescues a young girl from a deadly storm. This action sets off a chain of events, bringing him out of seclusion and both into harm’s way. As their lives intertwine, he must navigate protecting the orphaned girl while battling enemies from is past - setting them both on a breathless odyssey for survival and a deeper journey toward redemption.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"On a remote coastal island, a man living in self-imposed exile rescues a young girl from a deadly storm.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":107,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000262\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001557\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002147\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014866\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016569\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017459\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000088\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000251\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001694\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001819\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001\",\"0000000007\",\"0000000020\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"9e3b2fd7-c5b2-4dee-857d-9dc3d230e4cd\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008237\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009331\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Black Bear Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008239\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Kangaroo\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"KANGAROO is a heart-warming family comedy about ex TV personality, Chris Masterman, who becomes stranded in an Outback town outside Alice Springs. There, he teams up with 12-year-old Indigenous girl Charlie. The pair form an unlikely friendship and work together to rescue and rehabilitate orphaned joeys in the remote but stunning Outback community - an endeavour that proves to be life-changing for them both.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"KANGAROO is a heart-warming family comedy about an ex-TV personality Chris Masterman, who becomes stranded in an Outback town after a car accident on his way to Broome. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild bad language, threat, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":107,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BAwuJ74KP6U\",\"displayPriority\":12,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002636\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006784\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011449\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011614\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012011\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016712\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016713\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016714\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016715\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016716\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016717\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016718\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016719\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016720\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016721\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016722\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016723\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016724\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000016725\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002378\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"2190fa2f-4101-475d-848f-b328ee1f0b8d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008239\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009333\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"STUDIOCANAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008241\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Stitch Head\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s monster time! In a castle laboratory high above a little town, a Mad Professor brings … then promptly forgets all about them. So who looks monstrous creations to (almost)-LIFE after the castle? Who takes care of the monsters? Who teaches them NOT to be monstrous, so the townsfolk don’t form an Angry Mob and burn the castle to the ground? Meet Stitch Head the professor’s very first creation.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Meet Stitch Head, the first of many monstrous creations of a mad professor, who’s about to break out of his castle home to find fame and fortune! \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000011\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very mild threat, rude humour, upsetting scenes, violence, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":91,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SlHrSRmobKQ\",\"displayPriority\":14,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001141\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003295\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010210\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017460\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017461\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017462\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017463\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017464\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017465\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001278\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000010\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"2951842e-577b-4cfb-a291-a57668c68ee0\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008241\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009335\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Kazoo Films\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008273\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Primate\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In PRIMATE, a group of friends’ tropical vacation turns into a terrifying, primal tale of horror and survival.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In PRIMATE, a group of friends’ tropical vacation turns into a terrifying, primal tale of horror and survival.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":89,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L9Odp8RvbLo\",\"displayPriority\":10,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017524\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017525\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017526\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017527\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017528\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017529\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017530\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017532\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017533\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002732\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"67aa2582-ac18-4747-8f49-005d24853af3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008273\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009367\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Paramount Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008366\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Melania\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Offering unprecedented access to the 20 days leading up to the 2025 Presidential Inauguration — through the eyes of the First Lady-elect herself — step inside Melania Trump's world as she orchestrates inauguration plans, navigates the complexities of the White House transition, and reenters public life with her family. With exclusive footage capturing critical meetings, private conversations, and never-before-seen environments, Mrs. Trump returns to one of the world's most powerful roles.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Offering unprecedented access to the 20 days leading up to the 2025 Presidential Inauguration — through the eyes of the First Lady-elect herself.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild bad language, upsetting scenes, brief sexual violence references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":104,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002852\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017676\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017677\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000008\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e0b807dc-6fff-41b2-90d7-5637351348c3\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008366\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009466\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"SHEAR ENTERTAINMENT\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008390\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Iron Lung\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The stars are gone. The planets have disappeared. Only individuals aboard space stations or starships were left to give the end a name - The Quiet Rapture. After decades of decay and crumbling infrastructure, the Consolidation of Iron has made a discovery on a barren moon designated AT-5. An ocean of blood.\\u2028 Hoping to discover desperately needed resources they immediately launch an expedition. A submarine is crafted and a convict is welded inside. Due to the pressure and depth of the ocean the forward viewport has been encased in metal. If successful, they will earn their freedom. If not, another will follow. This will be the 13th expedition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The stars are gone. The planets have disappeared. Only those on space stations or starships were left to give the end a name. The Quiet Rapture. The universe dims.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, bloody images, threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":125,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017729\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\",\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"4187d757-ba5e-42e9-9ba3-f3aa56e6b45f\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008390\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009492\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"(New) Iron Lung Inc\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008395\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Border 2\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"During the events of the 1971 Indo-Pak war, a new generation of young Indian warriors were getting ready to defend the nation from an even bigger threat to the Indian motherland.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"During the events of the 1971 Indo-Pak war, a new generation of young Indian warriors were getting ready to defend the nation from an even bigger threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":199,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nvmc2ECk8Lo\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000133\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000231\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005031\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001128\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002713\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000024\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"263d0f31-f2aa-489e-b8db-f1bb8f88a009\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008395\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009497\